  "details": "Currently, what can be done in regards to the player seems extremely limited. I'm sure there's more, but it feels like about all I can do is get the player's name.\nBeing able to get the player's Transform position, Add Force to the player's RigidBody, setting the player's parent GameObject, etc. would allow for some incredibly cool things.\nI'm sure that there are some security concerns that would have to be addressed moving forward, but being able to access the player seems very important to make an advanced interactive world.",
